      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The King’s Singers represent the gold standard of vocal groups worldwide. Alongside the peerless viols of Fretwork, they perform a programme filled with beauty, drama and storytelling.  Their newly launched award-winning album Tom + Will marks 400 years since the death of two of England’s greatest c"
