    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "This will be the first try-out of the work-in-progress that is Albion: a musical examination of what it means to be British in a post-colonial, post-Brexit country -  a country profoundly uncertain of its future and wary of its past; a country that seems to want to hide itself under the warm duvet o"
