      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Dietrich Buxtehude’s intense cycle of sacred concerti focussing on parts of Christ’s body. Ad Cor is the fifth of the seven, and uses a consort of viols in place of the violins of the rest of the work."
      }
