      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Sebastiani’s setting of the gospel according to St Matthew was published in 1663 in Königsburg and was very influential in the generation before Bach. It employs just 5 voices, 4 viols, 2 violins and organ to depict Christ’s Passion. Fretwork is joined by Elisabeth Paul, Sam Boden, Hugo Hymas, Ben H"
      }
