      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come and play English concert music with Fretwork in the beautiful setting of Schloß Seehaus in Frankenland.   Participants will also be able to attend a famous Wandelkonzerte with Fretwork, Jan Kobow (tenor) and Alexander Chance (counter-tenor) on Sunday 23rd, two performances with a short ‘wander’"
      }
