        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Nico Muhly’s ‘My Days’, which sets some of Orlando Gibbons’ autopsy, is contrasted with Gibbons’ own vocal and instrumental music, including the uproarious Cries of London. With Anna Dennis, Alex Chance, Sam Boden, Hugo Hymas &amp; Jimmy Holliday."
